flowchart LR
    A[strace ./program] --> B[Intercept syscalls]
    B --> C[Display syscall trace]
    
    C --> D[open file.txt, O_RDONLY]
    D --> E[= 3 - fd returned]
    E --> F[read 3, buffer, 1024]
    F --> G[= 512 - bytes read]
    G --> H[write 1, buffer, 512]
    H --> I[= 512 - stdout]
    I --> J[close 3]
    J --> K[= 0 - success]
    K --> L[exit_group 0]
    
    M[strace options] --> M1[-c: count calls]
    M --> M2[-T: show time]
    M --> M3[-e trace=open: filter]
    M --> M4[-p PID: attach]
    
    style C fill:#fff4e1
    style E fill:#e8f5e8
    style G fill:#e8f5e8
